  "<h3 id=\"a-setext-heading\">A setext heading</h3>",
  "<p>Reference <a href=\"https://example.com/a\">links</a>, <a href=\"https://example.com/c\">collapsed</a>, <a href=\"https://example.com/s\">shortcut</a> and .</p>",
  "<figure><img alt=\"a reference image\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"8\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"image-d1066102\" width=\"8\"/></figure>",
  "<p>Escaped *stars*, # hash, [brackets], and a literal \\ backslash.</p>",
  "<p>Code with <code>a ` backtick</code> in it, and <code>`</code> alone.</p>",
  "<pre><code>indented code",
  "block</code></pre>",
  "<hr/>",
  "<hr/>",
  "<hr/>",
  "<p>empty, empty href, [js](javascript:alert(1)), &lt;javascript:alert(2)&gt;,",
  "[data](data:text/html;base64,PHNjcmlwdD4=), [vb](VBSCRIPT:x) and [file](file:///etc/passwd).</p>",
  "<figure><img alt=\"data image\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"8\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"image-4caece53\" width=\"8\"/></figure>",
  "<p>relative, <a href=\"/about\">root</a>, <a href=\"#a-setext-heading\">anchor</a>, query, <a href=\"mailto:jan@example.com\">mail</a>, <a href=\"tel:+31201234567\">phone</a>.</p>",
  "<p>Hard",
  "break, and a <em>nested <strong>strong</strong> inside</em> emphasis, <em><strong>both</strong></em> at once.</p>",
  "<ol><li>a paren list</li><li>second</li></ol>",
  "<ol start=\"7\"><li>starts at seven</li><li>eight</li></ol>",
  "<p>&lt;not a tag&gt; and &amp;unknown; entity and 😀 emoji.</p>",
  "<p>A very long word: Rindfleischetikettierungsüberwachungsaufgabenübertragungsgesetz.</p>",
  "<h2 id=\"heading-with-code-and-a-link\">Heading with <code>code</code> and <a href=\"https://example.com\">a link</a></h2>",
  "<h2 id=\"heading-with-trailing-hashes\">Heading with trailing hashes</h2>",
  "<p>#Not a heading</p>"
 ],
